@exhibitionId = 9b1d5e2a-0c4f-4e7a-9a51-3f1c0e8b0001
# Start the database and run the API in Visual Studio.
# At the top of this file, add a line like: @baseUrl = https://localhost:7137
# Use the address shown after "Now listening on" in your API output.
# Click "Send request" above the request you want to test.
# When you are done testing, delete the @baseUrl line you added.
# To test a specific game, copy gameId from the POST /api/v1/games response, add @gameId = <copied ID> at the top of this file, and delete that line after testing.




### Guest: active version -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/exhibitions/{{exhibitionId}}/active-version
Accept: application/json


### Unknown Exhibition -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/exhibitions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/active-version
Accept: application/json


### Auth: login with the test editor (expected: 200 + token)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@oekolariet.test",
  "password": "Udvikling123!"
}


### Auth: wrong password (expected: 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@oekolariet.test",
  "password": "WrongPassword"
}


### Auth: empty email (expected: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "",
  "password": "Udvikling123!"
}


### CMS: create draft without login (expected: 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/exhibitions/{{exhibitionId}}/draft


### CMS: create draft (expected: 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/exhibitions/{{exhibitionId}}/draft
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}


### CMS: create draft again (expected: 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/exhibitions/{{exhibitionId}}/draft
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}


### CMS: unknown exhibition (expected: 404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/exhibitions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/draft
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}


### CMS: Get Draft (Expected: 200 AFTER create draft, otherwise 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/exhibitions/{{exhibitionId}}/draft
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}


### CMS: Get Draft, unknown exhibition (Expected: 404 ProblemDetails)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/exhibitions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/draft
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}


### Guest: start game (expected: 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/games
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "exhibitionId": "{{exhibitionId}}",
  "avatarKey": "odder"
}

### Dagens highscore
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/games/{{gameId}}/highscores

### Månedens highscore
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/games/{{gameId}}/highscores?period=month

### Guest: complete a round after its timer expires
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/games/{{gameId}}/complete-expired
